<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44766" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐπέτ-εια</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐπετ-είη</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ease</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δι᾽ εὐπετείας</span>
			<i>easily</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				262
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετ᾽ εὐπετείας γίγνεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ti.</u>
					64d
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ πολλὴν εὐπέτειαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					6.52
				</span></i>
			: pl., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐπετείας διδόναι</span>
			give <i>facilities</i>, grant <i>indulgences</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακίας πέρι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					364c
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>easiness of getting</i> or <i>having</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυναικῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					5.20
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τροφῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Oec.</u>
					5.5
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν προθυμουμένων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					718d
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγορᾶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Nic.</u>
					20
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>easy decline, degeneration</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Nat.Hom.</u>
				12
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
